@startuml
title 16. Project Member Management
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #546E7A
  ArrowColor #607D8B
  DiamondBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
  DiamondBorderColor #546E7A
}
skinparam partition {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  BorderColor #90A4AE
}
|Project Manager|
start
:Open project members;
:Select employee;
:Assign project role,
permissions, and dates;

|System|
:Validate employee availability;
:Add employee to project;
:Notify employee;

|Employee|
:Access assigned project and tasks;

|Project Manager|
if (Remove or change member?) then (Yes)
  :Update role or remove member;
  |System|
  :Update access and assignments;
  :Notify employee;
endif
stop
@enduml
